{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_title", "source_sha256": "b113163707983fc10e05695fbcc6a0786c3eb16676a514c83640af7bb646a4a6", "ja": "ひなたとおでかけ2", "zh": "和日向外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a9d8ee25c3e32bfc640b3cd219f8500d73b5cde7f54996cfdd79e37315ff625a", "ja": "ひなたとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "和日向一起外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3c387ab4a2151458ef7842a243066488868767080f6e9c2d52044bdd2e058e0b", "ja": "（今日のオフはひなたと山形の町を散策。\n美術館にも立ち寄り、芸術作品を楽しんだ……）", "zh": "（今天休息时和日向一起逛了逛山形的街道。还顺便去了美术馆，欣赏了艺术作品……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b93c61313bb5a415e1cd66c23194fb79f31ed78a96dcb72701b205d46034a409", "ja": "絵画鑑賞、たまにはいいものだな……。\nひなたは何か気に入ったものとかあったか？", "zh": "偶尔欣赏一下绘画也挺不错的嘛……日向有没有喜欢的作品？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "e5dc7788495c7873d9b6216e7e4e7fbaca3a214aa7f1c1ac412dc5db947661bf", "ja": "そうだねぇ……やっぱり、\n自然の風景を描いた絵がよかったよぉ。", "zh": "是呀……我还是觉得，\n描绘自然风光的画最好哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6e58c176c495674640600c92850d8e756feec5f910a2599982d9534325f1aa95", "ja": "風景画か……種類も多かったしな。\n特に印象派は日本での人気も高いと聞くし。", "zh": "风景画啊……种类也很多呢。听说尤其是印象派，在日本也很受欢迎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "d0e0d8b33d62fe871b8f33726b2b46165caad1283eac9bc07dc7e40e3a26389b", "ja": "あたし、美術のことは詳しくないんだけども。\n見ていて、あったかい空気を感じたんだわ。", "zh": "我对美术不太了解。\n不过看着看着，感觉到了一种温暖的氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "bbda3769cbc10e5b997dd666a2bb7c0bb6800ac06d55b47a142aa90a7fdf2fbe", "ja": "光が柔らかくって、優しくって……\nなんて、ちょっとえらそうだったろか。", "zh": "光线柔和又温暖……\n这么说是不是有点自以为是了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "502e885d10fea2eebe172864492fea84467be8b96171b70f97295afbf6806a4b", "ja": "絵の良さを見つけるのは、ひなた自身だ。\nむしろその感性を、大切にしてほしいな。", "zh": "要发现画的优点，得靠日向自己。倒不如说，我希望她能珍惜自己的这份感性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "148a37dd9f19b816a0e6ef7cabe6c2ca1fcec861d80012bf91746819a3a51e43", "ja": "けど、柔らかくて優しくて、あたたかいか……むしろ\nひなた自身から、絵と同じ雰囲気を感じるかも……？", "zh": "可是，说到柔和、温柔又温暖……不如说，我反而觉得，ひなた自己身上也有着和画作一样的氛围……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "8a33b9b693eca9b4952abe7b549ce770208a77d310d9a71ce23ba59653cd4d63", "ja": "そ、そうかい？　あんな立派な絵と似てるなんて\n言われたら、照れるけども……。", "zh": "是、是吗？被说和那么棒的画很像，虽然会让人怪不好意思的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_035hin02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_035hin02_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "96592936f6aaf0aa2bc70c0d91c43c331036ffd1da665c98b831746145ee1ee4", "ja": "でも、綺麗なものと似てるのは、なまらうれしいねぇ。\nありがとうねぇ、{$P$}。", "zh": "不过，能和美丽的东西相像，真是特别开心呀。\n谢谢你，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
